What this plugin does (distribution notes)
------------------------------------------
This plugin registers an Easyship shipping method/integration for WooCommerce and makes
network requests to Easyship services to authenticate and fetch shipping rates (e.g., via
OAuth2/JWT assertion + rate endpoints).

